'''Lum Berry''' (Japanese: '''ラムのみ''' ''Lum Fruit'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=At the end of each turn, if the Pokémon this card is attached to is affected by any {{TCG|Special Condition}}s, it recovers from all of them, and discard this card.
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Lum Berry}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
*[[Lum Berry]] is a type of [[Berry]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that can be consumed by a Pokémon to cure it from {{DL|Status condition|Non-volatile status|non-volatile}} [[status condition]]s and {{status|confusion}}.
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Lum Berry|168}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.

